        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "啤酒還行。\n\n到處都是煙味。\n\n陌生人不停地向你兜售香菸。\n\n我看過最髒的廁所。\n\n電視卡頓得厲害。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Beers were okay.\nFull of smoking.\nRandom people kept asking you to buy cigarettes.\nDirtiest toilet I’ve ever seen.\nTVs were super laggy.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
